# Note dictation (F-006)

Staff can click **Dictate** on Add Note (sidebar + Communications tab). The
browser Speech Recognition API transcribes into the existing textarea. They
edit, then Save. Nothing auto-saves. Audio is not stored in the CRM.

## Invariants — do not regress

1. Reuse `DictationMicButton` + `useSpeechToText`. Do not add a second
   recognition path or a transcription API unless product asks to replace
   the browser API (Chrome needs a network connection; that is expected).
2. Append to existing text. Do not replace the field or save on stop.
3. Keep the control on **Add Note** first. **Add Call** is the next
   optional surface — same component, same rules.
4. Unsupported browsers get a disabled mic with a Chrome/Edge tooltip.
   Do not hide Add Note or block typing.

